"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 2000<br/>Christmas Update 2000</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20150706074548&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Coffin_Quest_2d5317.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a stone coffin.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Pyramid\">Dark Pyramid</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Deeper%20Catacombs\">Deeper Catacombs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth%2FCastle\">Vengoth Castle</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Somebody is buried in it. Perhaps you can find something useful in it.<br/>Unlike the <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Coffin\">Stone Coffin</a>, this coffin does not open upon using it and does not have volume.<br/><br/>Such coffins are part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%205000\">Key 5000</a> quest, <a href=\"#/quest/medusa-shield-quest\">Medusa Shield Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/stealth-ring-quest\">Stealth Ring Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/koshei-the-deathless-quest\">Koshei the Deathless Quest</a> and the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthei%27s%20Descent%20into%20Vampirism%20VII%20%28Book%29\">Arthei's Descent into Vampirism VII (Book)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coffins\">Coffins</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Containers\">Containers</a></li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Coffin\">Stone Coffin</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["blood-brothers-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"blood-brothers-quest","quest":"Blood Brothers Quest","step":"9-5","n":63,"title":"Livro VII no caixão","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32953,"y":31440,"z":3,"label":"Livro VII (Stone Coffin)"}]}]}}